# ============================================================
# ApexFormula — repository exclusions
# See Documentation/DECISION_LOG.md D-018 and D-022.
# ============================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Privacy — never commit reference or biometric-adjacent material
# ------------------------------------------------------------
LocalReference/
**/LocalReference/

# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Blender machine-local working files
# NOTE: BlenderPipeline/reports/ is deliberately NOT ignored.
# Validation reports are committed plain text (D-017).
# ------------------------------------------------------------
BlenderPipeline/local/
*.blend1
*.blend2
*.blend@

# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Scratch export directories — machine-local pipeline output
# Untracked under OPEN-074-A (D-069.4, D-074). Canonical mesh
# exports live in the committed pipeline output paths only.
# ------------------------------------------------------------
out/
out2/

# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Unreal Engine build output and caches
# ------------------------------------------------------------
Binaries/
Build/
DerivedDataCache/
Intermediate/
Saved/
Platforms/*/Binaries/
Platforms/*/Build/
Platforms/*/Intermediate/
Platforms/*/Saved/
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.VC.db
*.VC.opendb
*.opensdf
*.sdf
*.sln
*.suo
*.xcodeproj
*.xcworkspace

# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Packaged builds and archives
# ------------------------------------------------------------
Packaged/
Dist/
*.exe
*.msi
*.pak
*.zip
*.7z
*.rar

# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Credentials, keys and machine configuration
# ------------------------------------------------------------
*.pem
*.key
*.pfx
*.p12
*.keystore
.env
.env.*
secrets.*
credentials.*
LocalConfig/
*.local.ini
*.local.json

# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Python tooling artefacts
# ------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.mypy_cache/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Operating system noise
# ------------------------------------------------------------
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
.DS_Store

# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Logs and crash dumps
# ------------------------------------------------------------
*.log
*.dmp
*.stackdump
Crashes/

Unreal/Config/DefaultEditor.ini

# ------------------------------------------------------------
# UE Python diagnostic scratch scripts — machine-local (M5 debugging)
# Delivered scripts are committed explicitly and listed in
# Documentation/UE_SCRIPT_INVENTORY.md. One-off diagnostic
# experiments belong in the directory below and stay machine-local;
# a deliberately narrow directory rule is used instead of a broad
# m5*.py pattern so that future intentional scripts are never
# silently hidden from `git status`. Loose scratch m5x_*.py files
# still on the development machine are queued to move into this
# directory when the machine is next reachable.
# ------------------------------------------------------------
BlenderPipeline/tools/local_diagnostics/

# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Root-level tools/ — reserved, never a real directory here.
# The committed validators live in Tools/ with a capital T. On a
# case-insensitive filesystem (default Windows and macOS) a
# lowercase tools/ resolves to the same directory, so tracking both
# makes the checkout ambiguous on the development machine while CI
# on a case-sensitive filesystem sees two. tools/apply_open071a.py
# reached main exactly that way and is removed in this branch.
# Anchored with a leading slash so nested tools/ directories such as
# BlenderPipeline/tools/ stay visible to `git status`.
# ------------------------------------------------------------
/tools/
